Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.77,0:00:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's the final head count on my baby shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.77,0:00:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有多少人会来参加宝宝的欢迎会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:14.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About twenty. Couple people from work had something else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:14.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大约有20个人  有些同事有事没空过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also both of your sisters called and neither can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的妹妹们打电话来说她们没办法来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? You mean they're not coming to a social event
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  她们竟然不来参加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}where there's no men and no booze?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有男人跟酒精的社交聚会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的是太稀奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care, as long as my mom's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎  只要我妈能来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? My mom's not gonna be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么  我妈不会来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, given that we forgot to invite her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由于我们忘了邀请她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it would be a big coincidence if she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要是能来那还真是天大的巧合呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:39.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't my fault, Phoebe was in charge of the invitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:39.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是我的错  负责邀请来宾的是菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have a mother. So often I forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有妈妈  所以我常忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:44.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:44.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So my mother is not coming to my baby shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以说我妈不来参加宝宝的欢迎会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Neither is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈也不会来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.02,0:00:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.02,0:00:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll take care of it. We'll call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会处理的  我们会打电话给她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:58.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go home and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:58.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你先回家做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:02.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, make sure she comes. It's really important to me. It's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:02.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确定她一定会来  这对我很重要  她是我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I know. What's her number?  I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  她电话号码是多少  我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go. I have it in my book. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去吧  我记在我的电话簿里了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. If you're in charge of invitations,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  如果你负责邀请来宾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}why am I the one who has to call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那为什么是我打电话给她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Mrs. Green! Hi, it's Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂  格林太太  我是莫妮卡·盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, hello, Monica.  Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈喽  莫妮卡  嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know this is lastminute,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道时间紧促
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:27.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but we've decided to throw an impromptu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:27.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们打算在今天临时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.51,0:01:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...baby shower for Rachel today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.51,0:01:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮瑞秋的宝宝办欢迎会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:31.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, my daughter's told me about it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:31.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的女儿们已经告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:35.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when they received their impromptu invitations a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:35.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们一个月前就接到欢迎会的"临时"请帖了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:39.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:39.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For what, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么呢  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For not inviting me, or for lying about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了没有邀请我  还是说谎骗我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! My ass is sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我的屁股在流汗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:52.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, please, can you come? It starts at 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托了  您能来吗  四点开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:56.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Well, all right. I'll see you at 4.  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:56.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  四点见  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Isn't it at 3?  Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是三点开始吗  该死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E20 The One With The Baby Shower
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第20集  新生儿派对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Joe! Wanna shoot some hoops?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你要去打篮球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:45.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't go. I'm practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:45.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能去  我在练习
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:47.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got an audition to be the host of a new game show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:47.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要参加新游戏节日主持人的试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:48.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Cool!  Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:48.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酷啊  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我能当上主持人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.05,0:02:52.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}by day I'll be Dr. Drake Ramoray.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.05,0:02:52.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白天我是德雷克·拉莫瑞医生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But by night I'll be Joey Tribbiani!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但晚上我是乔伊·崔比安尼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be perfect for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你非常适合这份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:02:59.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's already your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:02:59.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用的都是你的真名耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The auditiors in a couple hours, and I don't understand the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再过几小时就要试镜了 我还没搞懂游戏规则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:05.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:05.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你需要帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, really? That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  那真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you guys can be the contestants!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们可以当参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:14.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I guess we can lose to juniorhigh girls some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:14.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}输球给初中女生这种事可以等以后再说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Let's play Bamboozled!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们来玩"晕头转向"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Bamboozled?  Yeah. Isn't that a cool name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晕头转向  对  那个名字很酷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:21.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Yeah!  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:21.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Okay. Our first contestant is Ross Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  第一位参赛者是罗斯·盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you tell us a little something about you Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做个简单的自我介绍吧  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:33.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm a paleontologist. I live in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:33.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是古生物学家  我住在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a son, Ben. Hi, Ben! And...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个儿子叫做本  嗨  本  还有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said, a little bit, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说了是简单介绍  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, how about you, Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呢  钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, I'm a headhunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个猎头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hook up outofwork Soviet scientists...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为卑鄙的第三世界国家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:49.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with rogue Third World nations. Hi, Rasputin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:49.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}招聘失业的苏联科学家  嗨  拉斯普廷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:53.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent! Let's play Bamboozled! Chandler, you'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:53.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  我们开始吧  钱德勒  你先来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:56.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What is the capital of Colombia?  Bogota.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:56.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哥伦比亚的首都在哪里  波哥大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:58.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Bogota, but close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:58.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是波格大  但很接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can either pass your turn to Ross
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以把机会让给罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:05.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or pick a Wicked Wango Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:05.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或选一张魔法机会卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What does a Wicked Wango Card do?  I should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}魔法机会卡可以做什么  我应该知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:12.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see. One moment, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:12.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我看看  请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:15.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we are. A Wicked Wango Card
