Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要抽卡片  好的  你抽到了贪心卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You get all of Ross' points!  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你拿到了罗斯所有的分数  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:19.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This game is kind of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:19.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个游戏开始好玩起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't think it's a little crazy that you get all my points...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得你拿到我的分数太疯狂了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think the contestants aren't supposed to speak to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}参赛者不该相互交谈的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:33.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why did you invite my mother?  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:33.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要邀请我妈来  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:35.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She wants to move in with me and Ross
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:35.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要搬过来跟我和罗斯住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:36.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to help take care of the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:36.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以便帮忙照顾宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} For how long?  Eight weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多久  八星期
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but, my God, a long lunch with her is taxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是跟她一起吃长午餐就是种折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I personally would be honored if she wanted to live with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她想跟我住  我会觉得很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她又听不到你拍马屁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:52.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:52.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:56.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't want your mother to move in with you, just tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:56.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果不希望她搬过去  你该直说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. You're right. I'm about to have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对  我就快生了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can tell my mother that I don't want her
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:01.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以说我不希望她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to just be sleeping on my couch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}睡在我家沙发上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll wanna sleep in my bed with me. This can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会睡在我床上 绝不能让那种事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. That is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go over there and tell her
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:11.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you don't want her to live with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:11.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不希望她搬过去跟你们住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:13.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Do not take no for an answer.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:13.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定要坚持立场  好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is great! Now she's gonna be mad at Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这简直太棒了  现在她会生瑞秋的气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm just gonna swoop in there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:21.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要趁虚而入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and be like the daughter she never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当她的乖女儿讨好她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have new respect for Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对钱德勒又产生了新的敬意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:32.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, everybody! It's time to open the presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:32.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  大伙们  该来拆礼物了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:37.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! I think the first gift that Rachel opens...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:37.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  瑞秋要拆的第一样礼物...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...should be from the grandmother of the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是外婆送的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you're the most important person in this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你是这里最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也是全世界最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:48.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:48.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有准备礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because I wasn't invited until the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我直到最后时刻才受到邀请
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But thank you so much, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但非常谢谢你  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for bringing that to everybody's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让大家都注意到这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about you less important people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们这些不太重要的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's open your presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来拆你们的礼物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay that you didn't get me a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没准备礼物也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I kind of did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我也算是送了你一样礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:08.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me! Eight weeks of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:08.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要跟你同住八个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:12.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. See, Mom, the truth is, I can do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:12.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  妈  事实上我可以自己照顾宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweet heart, I know you're gonna be a terrific mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝贝  我知道你会是个好妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:18.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just think you need a little help, especially at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:18.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我觉得一开始你还是需要有人帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:21.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But mom, I really know what I'm doing. I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:21.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道自己在做什么  我应付得来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Remember Twinkles?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  还记得亮亮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:27.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was a hamster. I'm not gonna vacuum up my baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:27.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是只仓鼠  我又不会拿吸尘器吸我的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, come on, Rach. It's present time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快来吧  瑞秋  拆礼物的时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're the glue holding this party together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是这个派对的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's kind of falling apart here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在这个派对也快毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, look!  Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看  哇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is from your friends at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你同事送的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:45.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my gosh! Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:45.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  哇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I know what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:49.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:49.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that a beer bong for a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是宝宝啤酒机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Darling, that's a breast pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:11:00.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女儿  那是挤奶器
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I say I was done guessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说过我猜完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:10.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:10.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇  这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:13.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} It's a Diaper Genie.  It dispenses clean diapers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:13.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是尿布精灵  是用来放干净尿布的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. It's where you put dirty ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是放脏尿布的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's gross. Why don't you take it outside
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真恶心  为什么不直接把脏尿布
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and throw it in a dumpster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丢在外面的垃圾桶里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna do that 10 times a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你每天要丢十次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:25.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, it goes 10 times a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:25.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  宝宝一天可以拉十次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we feeding this baby Indian food?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我们给她喂的是印度食物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:31.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, dear. That's what babies do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:31.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  宝宝都是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:35.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, listen to your mother. She is very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:35.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  听你妈妈的话  她非常聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:39.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, what are you planning on doing with the baby
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:39.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再说  你去倒垃圾的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:42.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}while you're trotting out to the garbage ten times a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:42.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的宝宝该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, I'd leave it on the changing table?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  把她放在尿布桌上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? What did I do? What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么  我做错了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't leave a baby alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能丢下宝宝一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:53.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:53.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:56.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you never leave a baby alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:56.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千万不能丢下宝宝一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It would... She wouldn't be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样... 她会很不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:02.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not as safe as she would be with me, the baby dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:02.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她跟我这个菜鸟妈妈在一起也会不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what?
