Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The game was too complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前的游戏太复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and research showed people didn't follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}调查显示观众无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well what's complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪里复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You spin the Wheel of Mayhem to go up the Ladder of Chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}转处罚轮  上机会梯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go past the Mud Hut through the Rainbow Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}穿越彩虹环  经过泥屋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to the Golden Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找到金猴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You yank his tail, and you're in Paradise Pond!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉它的尾巴就能到天堂池
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. All that's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那些都删掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:38.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's basically just a simple questionandanswer game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在这只是个简单的问答游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what's fun about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有什么好玩的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You expect me to host a boring game
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我主持这个无聊的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that's just people standing around answering questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就只是几个人站在那里傻傻地回答问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there'll be women in bikinis holding up the scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会有比基尼女郎举得分板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's play Bamboozled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来玩晕头转向吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:55.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and all those dinosaur knickknacks you have, Ross,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:55.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你买的那些恐龙小玩意  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:58.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought they might be more at home in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:58.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得还是放在车库里比较合适
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we don't have a garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没有车库
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I say garage? I meant garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说车库吗  我是说垃圾桶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:05.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what, Mrs. Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:05.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗  格林太太
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's not absolutely vital that you live with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不一定要跟我们住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:12.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Rachel needs help with the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:12.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋需要人帮忙带孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do. I really do. I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  我什么都不会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信那不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no? Pheebs, Monica, do I know anything about babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  菲比  莫妮卡  我会带孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} No. Not a thing.  It's frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啥都不会  令人发指
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:27.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even if she doesn't know anything, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:27.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算她不会  但是我会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a son. His mother and I didn't live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个儿子  他妈妈跟我没有住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:34.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When he was with me, I took care of him all the time, by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:34.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟我一起住时  我都是自己照顾他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:38.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} That's true. You do have another child.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:38.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  你还有一个孩子  对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟另一个女人生的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you no control, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有自制力吗  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a different issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是另一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:51.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The point is, when the baby comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:51.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是宝宝出生后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will be there to feed her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会帮忙喂她吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and bathe her and change her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:56.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮她洗澡  换尿布
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And more than that, I want to do all those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更重要的是  我愿意照顾她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:04.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You don't need me to live with you.  Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:04.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你们真的不需要我搬过去  对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. You're gonna be so missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我会想念你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You'll be a great father.  You'll be a wonderful grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会是个好爸爸  你会是个好外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello? I still don't know what the hell I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂  我还是不知道我该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:21.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every firsttime mother feels that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:21.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新手妈妈都会有那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:23.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:23.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以慢慢学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:28.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you will. Look, when you first came to the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:28.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以的   你刚到纽约来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:31.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you were this spoiled, helpless little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:31.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是个被宠坏的无助小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who still used Daddy's credit cards, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只会用爸爸的信用卡  记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:35.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope you're going somewhere with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:35.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望你下面的话有点建设性
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:39.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at you. You're this big executive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:39.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看你  你现在是个大主管了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:42.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are much more capable than you give yourself credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:42.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你比自己想象中能干多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no doubt you're gonna be an incredible mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信你会是个好妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Really?  I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:52.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:52.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, you two. I'm gonna get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:19:00.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, sweetheart, you stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:19:00.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  亲爱的  别送了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll let myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like I'm not here. Which I almost wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就当我没来过  我差点真的来不了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:08.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're just so funny. You're so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:08.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的太幽默了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:16.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. You have apologized to her, like, a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:16.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么  你跟她道过很多次歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she's been nothing but terrible to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果她对你的态度还是一样恶劣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:20.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't forget, you just threw her daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:20.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了  你刚刚帮她女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:24.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}a lovely, albeit slightly boring, shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:24.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}办了个稍显无聊的温馨欢迎会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she hasn't even thanked you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她甚至都没有谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.07,0:19:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.07,0:19:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:33.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you wanna say anything to her, tell her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:33.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么话想跟她说  直说无妨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:38.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:38.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}格林太太
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}格林太太
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is rude to leave a party without saying goodbye to the host.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不跟主人道别就离开派对是很无礼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And also, when someone apologizes to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人跟你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:50.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the decent thing to do is to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:50.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得体的做法是接受道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:53.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because what I did to you, it wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:53.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对你的所作所为并非故意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what you're doing to me now is plain spiteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你对我的态度太恶毒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Spiteful?  That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恶毒  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's time you took a good, hard look in the mirror, young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该好好去照镜子了  小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Old lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女士
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:09.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wrap it up. Wrap it up. Wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:09.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:14.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So whenever you're ready to apologize to me, I will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:14.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要你准备好跟我道歉  我会原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't feel my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的腿没有感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:26.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were fantastic! I'm so proud of you.
