Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:56.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay, I'm ready.  You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:56.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我准备好了  你确定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:59.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. I've done my studying, and I really know my stuff.
