Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Put your elbow in it.  Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用手肘去试  非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:14.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you put a baby down for a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:14.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如何哄宝宝小睡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:17.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Full, dry, on its back, no loose covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:17.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂饱她  换尿布  仰卧  被子盖紧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:17.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:17.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:19.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is an audio question.
