Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝宝发出这种声音时你该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check if it's wet, check if it's hungry, burp it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检查她是尿湿或饿了  帮她拍背
